{"2988440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Agora Project", "steam_appid": 2988440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agora Project is a small learning project where you unveil a short story about a girl going to a party.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATENTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my FIRST project and is not perfect. I was learning how to use the engine and how everything worked. I wanted to make it longer, but the release date was coming closer, and I didn't have more time. Lesson learned. Launch the game when it is ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOLLOW ANTTAREZ GAMES (MY STUDIO) SO YOU STAY TUNED FOR MY NEXT GAME.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT MY NEXT GAME (PROJECT BUTCHER BAKER)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's going to be a first-person psychological <strong>horror</strong> and <strong>investigation</strong> game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of the <strong>Return of the Obra Dinn</strong>, but <strong>based on real events</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the <strong>true story of the Butcher Baker</strong>, a <strong>serial killer</strong> from <strong>Alaska</strong>, in the <strong>80s</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the detective; I will not help you. <strong>Take</strong> a <strong>notebook</strong> <strong>and</strong> a <strong>pencil.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Realistic graphics</strong>, made with <strong>UE5</strong>. (Don't worry, your PC will run it).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks for the support. Sincerely, Luish Gutty, the creator</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agora Project is a small learning project where you unveil a short story about a girl going to a party.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATENTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my FIRST project and is not perfect. I was learning how to use the engine and how everything worked. I wanted to make it longer, but the release date was coming closer, and I didn't have more time. Lesson learned. Launch the game when it is ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOLLOW ANTTAREZ GAMES (MY STUDIO) SO YOU STAY TUNED FOR MY NEXT GAME.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT MY NEXT GAME (PROJECT BUTCHER BAKER)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's going to be a first-person psychological <strong>horror</strong> and <strong>investigation</strong> game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of the <strong>Return of the Obra Dinn</strong>, but <strong>based on real events</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the <strong>true story of the Butcher Baker</strong>, a <strong>serial killer</strong> from <strong>Alaska</strong>, in the <strong>80s</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the detective; I will not help you. <strong>Take</strong> a <strong>notebook</strong> <strong>and</strong> a <strong>pencil.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Realistic graphics</strong>, made with <strong>UE5</strong>. (Don't worry, your PC will run it).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks for the support. Sincerely, Luish Gutty, the creator</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "Agora Project is a very short horror game (~15 minutes). It's about a girl who was supposed to go to a party with her friends; little did she know what was going to happen later that day.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/header.jpg?t=17